# Tagged links to post on social profiles, e.g. https://harshh.pages.dev/via/linkedin
# Each one serves the home page (a rewrite, not a redirect, so the address
# stays), and Cloudflare Web Analytics lists the visit under that path. That is
# how visits get credited to each network: Web Analytics ignores ?utm_ query
# strings, and apps like LinkedIn and Instagram often send no referrer.
# Any name works after /via/, so a new network needs no change here.
/via/*  /  200
